{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>A barren vine</b> — only it has no power to bear fruit, and there is no fruit." "<b>He rendered it like</b> — he reckoned that it would bear its fruit, and it became like a vine that is barren, for when I multiplied its fruit — they multiplied the altars."], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:50:45.102626860Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}